    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i> </p><p>Silverplate is a special chroming process that adds a layer of tough composite material (often Dallorian Alloy) across the surface of any piece of gear. In addition to looking stylish, this gives the gear +2 DR (maximum DR 20). Armor with Silverplate does not grant its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> to its wearer, but does gain it against attacks directed specifically at the Armor. </p>",
